{"t":"Optional PvP","s":"optional-pvp-18a7a","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Optionalpvp_bc04ca.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Optionalpvp\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"48\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Optionalpvp_bc04ca.gif\" width=\"48\"/><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>An <b>Optional PvP</b> (i.e. \"optional Player versus Player\") world  is a world without PvP enabled. Secura was the very first Optional PvP world and is one of the busiest servers of Tibia. Optional PvP worlds have some limitations compared to regular worlds:\n</p>\n<ul><li>It is not possible to attack players.</li>\n<li>Summons are essentially considered players, so they may also not be attacked and may not attack other players or summons. This also means that you cannot train on players or summons.</li>\n<li>Skulls do not exist at all, not even the green skull.</li>\n<li>It is not possible to heal wild creatures.</li>\n<li>Attack runes used on other players/summons will have no effect.</li>\n<li>Spells that create a damaging field can be stepped on by players without consequence (generates a \"puff\" graphic). They will also be a different color compared to normal fields so you can tell the difference between a player/summon-made field and a normal field.</li></ul>\n<p>Although player killing is not possible, be cautious where you are idle, since you can be pushed to creatures that will cause your death. Even <a href=\"#/wiki/Rat\">rats</a> from <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a> sewers are quite commonly used to kill AFKers especially in Secura.\n</p><p>Also because player killing is not possible and because the servers are so busy, scammers, kill/loot(bag) stealers, other thieves and otherwise annoying people are a not-too-uncommon sight.\n</p><p>It is very recommended players who are willing to play Optional-PvP server read following pages:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Scam</li>\n<li>Hacking</li>\n<li>Tibia rules</li></ul>\n<p>Scam, hacking and rule-breaking is pretty common on optional-pvp, and since a lot of players like to report others for anything, all caution is not enough, By reading these three pages, you will save yourself from getting hacked, scammed and/or banned.\n</p><p>Since the world is <b>Optional</b> PvP, is it much more community based and a great place to chat with friends and enjoy others company without hunting or killing things. Some people just group around a house or depot and chat for hours on end.\n</p><p>An Optional PvP world usually has a name that in some way is connected with peace. Examples are Secura, the secure world; Calmera, the calm world; Honera, the honest world; Celesta, the celestial world and Guardia, the guarded world.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Optional_PvP_Game_Worlds\">Optional PvP Game Worlds</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>Type\n</th>\n<th>Online since\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Astera\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\" valign=\"middle\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"USA\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"11\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/USA_f9ec4f.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>Optional PvP\n</td>\n<td>January 25, 2005\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Belobra\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\" valign=\"middle\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Brazil\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"11\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Brazil_3a7cdd.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>Optional PvP\n</td>\n<td>December 13, 2016\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Blumera\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\" valign=\"middle\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"m